 as a museum and the first structure built in Crater Lake National Park using rustic stone masonry construction. It is listed on the National Register of Historic Places as Sinnott Memorial Building No. 67.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinnott_Memorial_Observation_Station","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","attribution":"Wikipedia"},"photos":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Crater_Lake_National_Park1.jpg/960px-Crater_Lake_National_Park1.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crater_Lake_National_Park1.jpg","dist_m":6,"width":640,"height":427,"license":"CC BY 2.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","artist":"miketnorton"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Crater_Lake%2C_Crater_Lake_National_Park%2C_Crater_Lake%2C_OR_-_53849031686.jpg/960px-Crater_Lake%2C_Crater_Lake_National_Park%2C_Crater_Lake%2C_OR_-_53849031686.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crater_Lake,_Crater_Lake_National_Park,_Crater_Lake,_OR_-_53849031686.jpg","dist_m":8,"width":640,"height":480,"license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","artist":"w_lemay"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Crater_Lake_Far_Out.jpg/960px-Crater_Lake_Far_Out.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crater_Lake_Far_Out.jpg","dist_m":8,"width":640,"height":853,"license":"CC0","license_url":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","artist":"MallardTV"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Crater_Lake%2C_Crater_Lake_National_Park%2C_Crater_Lake%2C_OR_-_53848146112.jpg/960px-Crater_Lake%2C_Crater_Lake_National_Park%2C_Crater_Lake%2C_OR_-_53848146112.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crater_Lake,_Crater_Lake_National_Park,_Crater_Lake,_OR_-_53848146112.jpg","dist_m":9,"width":640,"height":480,"license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.o